    "created_at": "2016-09-06T14:42:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-06T14:42:12Z",
    "body": "Oh, and \"I'm OK with this\" comments without actual working code that has made it at least close to the release channel is not at all what I'd expect for \"implementers are willing to go at it\".  Words are cheap.  Actual willingness to make a change is a lot less so.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
